{
  "id": "mega-battle",
  "name": "Mega Battle",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Mega Battles were Japan's spring championships of the XY era: the Lizardon Mega Battle in 2014, the Rayquaza Mega Battle in 2015 and the Kamex Mega Battle in 2016, the first and last reusing the names of the 1997-98 Lizardon and Kamex Mega Battle series. Each held regional tournaments in May and a Japan Championship in June whose top finishers were invited to that year's World Championships, and the top three of each league at each venue won Victory Ring in gold, silver or bronze, stamped with the event's logo.",
